    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/bf31481b57618c7cc0463288ddadd837.poster.avif?t=1677215375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/bf31481b57618c7cc0463288ddadd837.webm?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/bf31481b57618c7cc0463288ddadd837.mp4?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Penguin Slide is a first-person physics based casual &quot;speedrunning&quot; game where the player is tasked at helping Flippy the Penguin as he runs away from the City Zoo on his mission to end global warming. Slide your way through diverse environments as Flippy travels farther and farther away from his human made enclosure, dodging obstacles and collecting coins and upgrades, on his epic journey to find a fabled secret U.S Cold War &quot;cryo-weapon&quot; to cool the planet and save the eco-system!<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 High Speed Gameplay<br>\u2022 Multiple Environments<br>\u2022 Highscore<br>\u2022 Steam Achievements<br>\u2022 Collectables<br>\u2022 In-game Store<br>\u2022 Fun Gameplay!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/b31551d1141a436787910db25f57b528.poster.avif?t=1677215375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/b31551d1141a436787910db25f57b528.webm?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/b31551d1141a436787910db25f57b528.mp4?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/bf31481b57618c7cc0463288ddadd837.poster.avif?t=1677215375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/bf31481b57618c7cc0463288ddadd837.webm?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/bf31481b57618c7cc0463288ddadd837.mp4?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Penguin Slide is a first-person physics based casual &quot;speedrunning&quot; game where the player is tasked at helping Flippy the Penguin as he runs away from the City Zoo on his mission to end global warming. Slide your way through diverse environments as Flippy travels farther and farther away from his human made enclosure, dodging obstacles and collecting coins and upgrades, on his epic journey to find a fabled secret U.S Cold War &quot;cryo-weapon&quot; to cool the planet and save the eco-system!<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 High Speed Gameplay<br>\u2022 Multiple Environments<br>\u2022 Highscore<br>\u2022 Steam Achievements<br>\u2022 Collectables<br>\u2022 In-game Store<br>\u2022 Fun Gameplay!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/b31551d1141a436787910db25f57b528.poster.avif?t=1677215375\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/b31551d1141a436787910db25f57b528.webm?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307230/extras/b31551d1141a436787910db25f57b528.mp4?t=1677215375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
